8f4e/v1

note
; @config runtime TestRuntime
; @memoryRegions sampleMemory

A group binding carries its source memory region and pointee element count into compilation.
noteEnd

entry test
module source
#region sampleMemory
int8[] values 4 11 12 13 14
moduleEnd

group reader
expose input &processor:input
bind &input &source:values

module processor
int8* input
push *input
assertEqual 11
push count(*input)
assertEqual 4
push sizeof(*input)
assertEqual 1
moduleEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
